<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17212" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτριπτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτριβής, χεῖρας ἀτρίπτους
					ἁπαλάς</span>
			
			<i>not worn hard by work,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				21.151
			</span></i>; of corn, <i>not threshed,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				18.5
			</span></i>; of bread, <i>not kneaded,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				929a17
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μᾶζα</span>”
				<i>not pounded,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Vict.</u>
					2.40
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. ἄκανθαι</span>
			<i>trackless</i> thorns, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				13.64
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέλευθοι ἄ.</span>
			<i>untrodden</i> ways, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				4.68
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. φρονήσεως ὁδοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.316
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>unknown, strange,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Artem.
				4.63
			</span></i>; of a problem, <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Ph.</u>
				520.23
			</span></i>.</div>
